<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Clear Channel raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Clear Channel raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it upgraded Clear Channel Communications Inc to &quot;outperform significantly&quot; from &quot;outperform.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Clear Channel gained 1/8 to 49-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
